<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="top-header">
    <div class="left">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>
    <div class="right">
      <span>关于本报告</span>
      <span>走进美的</span>
      <span>可持续发展治理</span>
      <span>守护蓝色星球</span>
      <span>构建和谐社区</span>
      <span>践行科技尽善</span>
      <span>共创繁荣生态</span>
      <span class="active">附录</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="main-title">附录三 关键绩效数据表</div>

  <div class="columns-wrap">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="column">
      <div class="pill-badge">温室气体排放数据</div>
      <table class="t1">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>指标名称</th>
            <th class="num">2024年</th>
            <th class="num">2023年</th>
            <th class="num">2022年</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">温室气体排放总量（范围1+2）<br>（吨二氧化碳当量）</td>
            <td class="num">2,203,472</td>
            <td class="num">2,298,311</td>
            <td class="num">1,505,877</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">温室气体排放强度<br>（吨二氧化碳当量/万元产值）</td>
            <td class="num">0.055</td>
            <td class="num">0.061</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围1<sup>25</sup>温室气体排放</td>
            <td class="num">681,036</td>
            <td class="num">1,017,606</td>
            <td class="num">129,400</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围2<sup>26</sup>温室气体排放</td>
            <td class="num">1,522,436</td>
            <td class="num">1,280,705</td>
            <td class="num">1,376,477</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围3<sup>27</sup>温室气体排放</td>
            <td class="num">196,247,729</td>
            <td class="num">4,960,000</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围3 - 类别1采购的产品与服务</td>
            <td class="num">8,494,973</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围3 - 类别4 上游运输</td>
            <td class="num">1,340,856</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">范围3 - 类别11 已售出产品使用</td>
            <td class="num">186,411,900</td>
            <td class="num">4,960,000</td>
            <td class="num">/</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">温室气体排放总量（范围1+2+3）<br>（吨二氧化碳当量）</td>
            <td class="num">198,451,201</td>
            <td class="num">7,258,311</td>
            <td class="num">1,505,877</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="column">
      <div class="pill-badge">其他环境数据</div>
      <table class="t2">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>指标名称</th>
            <th></th>
            <th>单位</th>
            <th class="num">2024年</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="5">废气排放</td>
            <td class="item">废气排放总量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">388.79</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">氮氧化物（NOx）排放量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">56.58</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">硫氧化物（SOX）排放量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">45.60</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">挥发性有机化合物（VOC）</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">165.47</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">颗粒物质（PM）</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">119.99</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="4">废弃物</td>
            <td class="item">有害废弃物总量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">20,451.20</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">有害废弃物强度</td>
            <td class="unit">吨/万元产值</td>
            <td class="num">0.0005</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">一般固废总量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">729,790.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">一般固废强度</td>
            <td class="unit">吨/万元产值</td>
            <td class="num">0.0182</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="1">废弃物</td>
            <td class="item">一般固废回收利用量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">19,811.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="7">能源使用<sup>28</sup></td>
            <td class="item">综合能源消耗总量</td>
            <td class="unit">千个千瓦时</td>
            <td class="num">3,528,346.64</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">直接能源消耗总量</td>
            <td class="unit">千个千瓦时</td>
            <td class="num">748,516.55</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">间接能源消耗总量</td>
            <td class="unit">千个千瓦时</td>
            <td class="num">2,779,830.09</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">能耗强度</td>
            <td class="unit">千个千瓦时/万元产值</td>
            <td class="num">0.088</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">汽油耗量</td>
            <td class="unit">升</td>
            <td class="num">67,721.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">柴油耗量</td>
            <td class="unit">升</td>
            <td class="num">279,583.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">压缩/管道天然气耗量</td>
            <td class="unit">立方米</td>
            <td class="num">68,895,974.49</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="2">水资源使用</td>
            <td class="item">总耗水量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">23,862,429.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">总耗水强度</td>
            <td class="unit">吨/万元产值</td>
            <td class="num">0.5966</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="cat" rowspan="2">包装材料使用<sup>29</sup></td>
            <td class="item">总使用量</td>
            <td class="unit">吨</td>
            <td class="num">655,836.00</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="item">使用密度</td>
            <td class="unit">吨/万元产值</td>
            <td class="num">0.0164</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footnotes">
    <div class="col">
      <div>25 范围1温室气体主要来自于固定生产设备、移动源及食堂等化石能源消耗和产品制造过程中冷媒逸散等。</div>
      <div>26 范围2温室气体包括外购电力、热力。以上排放活动数据来源于费用发票、生产报表等。电力碳排放因子取自生态环境部《关于发布2022年电力二氧化碳排放因子的公告》及国际能源署《IEA Emission Factors 2022》，外购热力排放系数参考国家发展改革委《企业温室气体排放核算方法与报告指南（试行）》。采购物料的碳排放因子取自ecoinvent 3.8数据库。其他碳排放系数参考 IPCC 2006 年《国家温室气体清单编制指南（试行）》等。</div>
      <div>27 2024年度较往年范围3温室气体排放源新增统计了采购的产品与服务、上游运输，且进一步完善了已售出产品品类。</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <div>28 2024年，本集团消耗的能源类型包括固定设备燃料耗用、公务车燃油、员工食堂燃料、外购电力、外购热力，以上数据来源为相关燃料发票或生产报表；能耗系数参考国际能源署提供的转换因子以及国家《GB/T 2589-2020 综合能耗计算通则》。</div>
      <div>29 包装材料包括瓦楞纸、特种纸等纸质材料。</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-footer">
    <div class="col">143</div>
    <div class="col" style="text-align:right;">144</div>
  </div>
</div>
